<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Bike Transportation in West Godavari | Insured Shifting Services
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What makes bike transportation in West Godavari different from regular courier services?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our bike transportation in West Godavari uses dedicated hydraulic ramp trailers, a 7‑layer shock‑absorbent packaging system, and a zero‑scratch guarantee backed by IRDAI‑approved insurance. Unlike standard couriers, we provide live GPS tracking, IBA‑compliant documentation, and specialized handling for premium and sports bikes.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I ship my bike by train instead of road from West Godavari?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">While Indian Railway bike parcel service is available, road‑based bike transportation in West Godavari offers faster door‑to‑door delivery, real‑time tracking, and a zero‑scratch guarantee that rail parcels cannot match. Our service also handles insurance and documentation in a single seamless process.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How is the insurance coverage calculated for my bike during transit?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">We provide 100 % declared‑value insurance approved by IRDAI. The premium is calculated based on the bike’s market value, type (commuter, premium, sports), and the distance of the route. The cost is transparently listed in the quotation and included in the final invoice.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documentation do I need to provide for bike transportation in West Godavari?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">You will need a valid vehicle registration certificate, a government‑issued ID, and a signed insurance declaration. Our team prepares the IBA‑approved mover code paperwork, GST invoice, and e‑Way bill, ensuring compliance for both personal and corporate reimbursement claims.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is there a minimum or maximum weight limit for bikes that can be transported?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our hydraulic ramp trailers can accommodate bikes ranging from lightweight scooters (up to 150 kg) to heavyweight premium motorcycles (up to 350 kg). Each bike is individually assessed during the pre‑transport inspection to ensure safe loading within the trailer’s weight capacity.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How can I track my bike during the journey from West Godavari to the destination hub?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Once the bike is loaded, a satellite‑linked GPS device is activated on the trailer. You receive a secure link to our client portal where you can view live location, estimated arrival time, and receive instant alerts for any status changes, ensuring complete visibility.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What are the typical transit times for bike transportation from West Godavari to major Indian cities?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Transit time varies by distance and traffic conditions but generally ranges from 2 days for nearby hubs to 5‑6 days for far‑flung metros like Delhi or Mumbai. Our optimized highway routes and dedicated fleet minimize delays, and you receive regular updates throughout the journey.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
